Description: Orcaopta Control Plane CLI
 A unified cloud automation CLI for MCP, ML, RL, observability,
 autoscaling, node operations, Spark pipelines, blockchain logging,
 and cluster graph visualization. Provides operator-grade commands
 for managing Orcaopta deployments across distributed systems.
